  "title": "NFFC 26/27 Home Shirt",
  "handle": "nffc-26-27-home-shirt",
  "description": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Inspired by the mist rising from the River Trent, the Nottingham Forest 26/27 Home Shirt uses tonal shades of red to create a subtle nod to Nottingham's landscape, combining local heritage with a modern on-pitch look.</p>\n<p>Cool. Dry. Ready. Climacool wicks and disperses sweat for a cool, dry and distraction-free performance, so you can focus on your technique. Quick-drying doubleknit fabric offers a comfortable feel, from kick-off to the final whistle, while the slim fit is flexible and moves with your body.</p>\n<p>Designed with a V-neck for a classic touch, the short sleeve shirt has an all-over printed graphic with collar and cuff piping details, making it a standout piece. An embroidered adidas logo and signature 3-Stripes add the final touches to the design.</p>\n<p>More than just a jersey, it's a symbol of optimism and unity, embodying the spirit of football legends in a classic format with a modern twist.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Slim fit</li>\n<li>V-neck</li>\n<li>Main Material: 100% Polyester(100% Recycled)</li>\n<li>Doubleknit fabric</li>\n<li>Regular length</li>\n<li>CLIMACOOL technology</li>\n<li>adidas branding elements</li>\n<li>Quick-drying fabric</li>\n<li>Club crest</li>\n<li>Product code: JY8110</li>\n</ul>",
